  Q['23.228#5.2.2.3'] = { spec: 'TS 23.228', text: 'The application level registration can be initiated after the registration to the access is performed and after IP connectivity for the signalling has been gained from the access network. For the purpose of the registration information flows, the user is considered to be always roaming. For user roaming in their home network, the home network shall perform the role of the visited network elements and the home network elements. Figure 5.1: Registration – User not registered 1.…' };
